Z||000000||Butter||06-19-2001||12:56 PM||||Hey Folks,<P>A thought has occurred to me.  Now this is amazing in its self.  Before I loose it, let me try and get it out.  After looking at the décor in my shop and realizing it needed cleaning up, it always needs cleaning up, I reckin’ it needs some eye spots.  You know a place your eye wants to go so you don’t notice the rest of the mess.  I got these calendars here and there from years present and past.  Folks that visit always wind up lookin’ at them at one point or another.  I put up the kind that has a couple things I love, cars and women.  Now I have seen some real nice pics in this forum that could make a nice calendar.  I have also seen some neat computer work by some of the computer gurus on here.<P>You folks reckin’ we could create an Official Pennock’s Forum Calendar?  Cliff could set up the rules of post and we all could vote on it each month.  Maybe give a different theme for each month so it would be a diverse calendar with a chance for different modifications to be shown.  Maybe a little write up buy the submitters as to how and why they did what they do.  I think this would create a good way to show off the things we enjoy sporting and give inspiration to those that can appreciate it.  It would definitely be a conversation piece in my shop.<P>Cliff, What’s the chances?<BR>||||reg||3
