Z||000006||Songman||06-19-2001||04:23 PM||||I see what you are saying and you are correct that it hasn't been done...<P>You are talking about not just someone putting together a calendar to sell, but doing something as a forum where the entire membership has a say on content...<P>I don't see why it couldn't be done, if Cliff wanted to pursue it.. It doesn't have to be something that is sold. You can vote for the July theme/car in June and have it available online for download and printing...<P>Sounds pretty cool to me...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||14
Z||000007||Butter||06-19-2001||04:41 PM||||Maybe I didn't get my point across to well as you know how us Hillbillys can be.  This Idea was a combination of things I've come across from time to time.  Maybe yall should take the calendar part out so you can understand the point.  I was more tring to get a forum vote on particular modifications that members have made.  A FREE Downloadable or printable calendar would be a way to advertise the more popular ideas people have that would inspire those of us like myself who seek new ideas to try out. My fingers are longer winded than my lungs.  <BR>By the way, is they any of those 2001 calendars left with the many fine looking cars on it? The past thread I was scanning over on it appeared to be in limited supply.  I won't read all the post I've missed by not finding this site before I did.  I bet most of you can say the same thing.  I was just throwin' out a twist on something yall aready have goin' on.  Even I can pick out the modifications I like on the forum and make a calendar out of it.  I can not get your valued opinions on what to put in it.  This is my idea at giving folks inspiration for doing popular modifications.  <P>Now I ain't lookin' for no flames.  I was Lookin' to see if Cliff could set up some kind of voting spot.  It could be used for other ideas members may come up with.<P>||||reg||7
