Z||000022||AusFiero||07-17-2001||01:42 AM||||I offered to do one but only got 1 negative comment and 3 pics posted to me. Offer still stands. It will be free and downloadable. Also it wont just be pictures, it will be art.<P>Keep those high resolution pics coming to jim@jadeweb.com.au and I will produce a wall and desk calendar that will be available.<P>The pics must be very high resolution shots to make it work. 1024 X 768 preferably but 800 X 600 I can manipulate. Also resolution needs to be 300 DPI or greater, not a net resolution of 72 DPI.<P>I wasn't trying to muscle in on your terrritory as someone suggested Eco and I am sure people have really appreciated your efforts to date from what I have read, just trying to put some quality art out there for all to enjoy. <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
